chip ym2608
clock 7987200
samples 24000
mem io opn-io.bin
fidelity med
# The YM2608's SSG, mixed into its third output, at the medium fidelity
# through each prescale (4:3, 2:3, 1:3), then the fidelity changed to the
# maximum and the minimum; the SSG's I/O ports and registers read back
# through the data port, and the ID code at 0xFF.
